{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01466",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.5,
      "end_seconds": 3.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "Hello, good to see you. Please sit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.7,
      "end_seconds": 9.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "Morning, doctor, sorry about the rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 11.2,
      "end_seconds": 12.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "Where shall we begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.29,
      "end_seconds": 18.9,
      "duration_seconds": 4.61,
      "text": "Well, I've been having scaling on the scalp."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.58,
      "end_seconds": 27.35,
      "duration_seconds": 6.77,
      "text": "How long has this been bothering you? I'm asking so that we don't miss anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.4,
      "end_seconds": 32.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "I've had it for four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 46.78,
      "end_seconds": 60.78,
      "duration_seconds": 14.0,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. Heart rate 80, weight 75 kilos. Height 167 centimetres, SpO2 99 percent on room air, blood pressure 123 over 80, respiratory rate 16."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.01,
      "end_seconds": 64.71,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.26,
      "end_seconds": 71.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "Now I'm going to do a short physical check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.29,
      "end_seconds": 73.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "Fine by me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.41,
      "end_seconds": 77.38,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "I'm just checking this side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.51,
      "end_seconds": 95.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "A few small pits in the fingernails."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 97.45,
      "end_seconds": 98.82,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "Fine by me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.79,
      "end_seconds": 102.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "Alright, I'm just checking this side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.07,
      "end_seconds": 121.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "Well-defined thick silvery plaques over both elbows and knees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.15,
      "end_seconds": 130.7,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "Please sit back down. Alright, nothing like joint swelling?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.64,
      "end_seconds": 134.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "No joint swelling, thankfully."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 136.04,
      "end_seconds": 142.97,
      "duration_seconds": 6.93,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any eye redness or sore throat before it started?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.77,
      "end_seconds": 149.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "No, no eye redness or sore throat before it started."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.45,
      "end_seconds": 154.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "Alright, anything different when you pass water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.87,
      "end_seconds": 157.28,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "No changes there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.84,
      "end_seconds": 161.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "How are your joints, any aches elsewhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 163.22,
      "end_seconds": 164.87,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.59,
      "end_seconds": 169.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "What's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.32,
      "end_seconds": 173.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "I take coconut oil, daily."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.93,
      "end_seconds": 175.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.18,
      "text": "Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 176.67,
      "end_seconds": 180.9,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "I smoke roughly a pack every two days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.4,
      "end_seconds": 184.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "And alcohol, how much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 185.09,
      "end_seconds": 187.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "I only drink at family occasions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.32,
      "end_seconds": 191.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "Right, how are your meals?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.73,
      "end_seconds": 196.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "I grab fast food at lunch most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.19,
      "end_seconds": 199.82,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "Who lives with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 201.34,
      "end_seconds": 203.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "My partner and our baby."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.68,
      "end_seconds": 224.91,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "Are there any allergies I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 230.07,
      "end_seconds": 232.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "No, I've never reacted to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.64,
      "end_seconds": 235.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 236.0,
      "end_seconds": 239.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "Nothing, I haven't had any operations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.28,
      "end_seconds": 252.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "Any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 253.41,
      "end_seconds": 254.87,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "Not really, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.09,
      "end_seconds": 261.77,
      "duration_seconds": 5.68,
      "text": "So, based on the history and the examination, it points towards plaque psoriasis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.69,
      "end_seconds": 299.13,
      "duration_seconds": 18.44,
      "text": "Let's get blood tests, for baseline before treatment. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more. The treatment will be calcipotriol-betamethasone gel, once a day, for four weeks. That's for psoriasis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 300.1,
      "end_seconds": 303.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "Fine, uh, I'll begin it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 307.38,
      "end_seconds": 319.32,
      "duration_seconds": 11.94,
      "text": "A little sunlight helps psoriasis, but avoid sunburn. Moisturise often. I'd like to see you again in six weeks. Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 321.37,
      "end_seconds": 324.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "So, thank you, doctor, goodbye."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 326.08,
      "end_seconds": 327.38,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3,
      "text": "All the best."
    }
  ]
}